.claude/worktrees/

# Consumed toolchain — restored per-machine, never redistributed.
# These hold ~500 vendored BMAD skill files plus symlinks into a sibling
# Koni-Skills checkout: this repo's dev tooling, not its product. Committing
# them would republish third-party skill content under our LICENSE and bury
# skills/ + templates/ (the ~20 files that matter) in noise.
# Restore with the commands in docs/SETUP.md §6.
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/

# skills workspace
*-workspace/

